# held/weapons/glaive: the glaive (art weapon 8 with polearmForm 2, `held spear.glaive`: the Jade lancer's arm), LADDER-ARMS
# i1 2026-10-23. The spear's ash haft, grips, carries, falls and drop (held/weapons/spear) with a 6 px single-edged head in
# place of the leaf: a brass socket, the blade swelling to 3 px with its lit edge toward the top-left light and a white
# point (C6), a dark back. Every view the spear has, at the same origins (the grip), so every spear clip serves it.
# Finish regions (contracts 3b): R the socket, N the blade's back line (the rune line at T6), G a pixel at the socket.
use person
body adult
role held spear
role held spear.glaive
layer held
anchor grip
keys held
tags anyfacing

